## Research Complexity Scale

| Task Complexity | Required Research | Min Sources |
|-----|----|----|
| **Simple** (typo fix, rename) | Verify context, check implications | 0-1 |
| **Medium** (API usage, config change) | Context7 + WebSearch | 1-2 |
| **Complex** (new library, feature) | Context7 + WebSearch + WebFetch | 2+ |
| **Critical** (auth, crypto, security) | Context7 + WebSearch + WebFetch + OWASP | 3+ |

> **Note**: Even simple tasks benefit from checking context and implications. The minimum source counts are floors, not ceilings.

---

## Fallback Strategy

If research tools fail:
1. Context7 not found -> WebSearch official docs
2. WebSearch empty -> WebFetch known URLs
3. WebFetch blocked -> Note in plan, ask user for docs
4. Document which tools failed in plan
